    haven\u2019t tidied up much\u2026 it\u2019s not very presentable, sorry.","_text_jp":"\u5bb6\u304c\u3042\u307e\u308a\u7247\u4ed8\u3044\u3066\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u898b\u82e6\u3057\u3044\u3051\u3069\u8a31\u3057\u3066\u306d\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u6751\u957f","_actorParameterID":"07c4887c-86e1-4bb1-9a34-982c2ed86707","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":100.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"3"},{"FaceType":{"_value":4},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u6211\u4e5f\u662f\u7a81\u7136\u5230\u8bbf\u3002","_text_en":"That\u2019s
